{"id":442,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It lays curses by thinking wicked thoughts. Writings tell that this Pokémon was born out of the assembly of five score and eight malevolent spirits."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"All Spiritomb’s mischief and misdeeds compelled a traveler to use a mysterious spell to bind Spiritomb to an odd keystone."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Exactly 108 spirits gathered to become this Pokémon. Apparently there are some ill-natured spirits in the mix."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Pearl"],"text":"It was bound to a fissure in an odd keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Diamond"],"text":"A Pokémon that was formed by 108 spirits. It is bound to a fissure in an odd keystone."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It was formed by uniting 108 spirits. It has been bound to the Odd Keystone to keep it from doing any mischief."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pressure","hidden":false,"description":"Puts other Pokémon under pressure, causing them to expend more PP to use their moves."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":30,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Purple","shape":"Blob","evolution":{"id":442,"name":"Spiritomb","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,101],[1,109],[5,425],[10,180],[15,371],[20,417],[25,506],[30,262],[35,389],[40,174],[45,247],[50,399],[55,95],[60,138]],"machine":[34,807,347,109,174,399,203,263,492,416,270,506,63,196,286,808,417,101,220,566,809,182,60,94,473,240,156,317,184,247,285,214,555,180,500,164,241,269,851,168,92,271,433,261],"egg":[502,194,50,220,108],"tutor"